   "value": "SOURCING D-750 2026-09-18. CORRECTION, not a selection: D-237 (FBV2-EXP-002) replaced the 2x12 Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE with the 1x24 Samtec SSQ-124-02-G-S-RA and moved the Footprint and Datasheet properties, but left MPN, LCSC, Description, Alternate, Note and Note2 on the superseded part, so every released BOM named a 2x12 2-row socket against a PCB carrying one row of 24 pads at x = 65.900. Re-verified live 2026-09-18 per D-096 through the JLCPCB parts API: SSQ-124-02-G-S-RA = LCSC C3323671, Samtec, 1 row, 24P, 2.54 mm, right angle, square hole, gold, stock 0, expand library."
